{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101770/extras/2666939de3dc29f7fd04dfe77e39eb1d.poster.avif?t=1761062311\" width=1170 height=534 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101770/extras/2666939de3dc29f7fd04dfe77e39eb1d.webm?t=1761062311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101770/extras/2666939de3dc29f7fd04dfe77e39eb1d.mp4?t=1761062311\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Black Fog</strong> is a survival horror with narrative elements, following the story of Kat and Eleanor, two ex-band members who haven't spoken in over two years. When a dark fog infused with a deadly neurotoxin encompasses the nation, Kat is inflicted with rampant hallucinations, unable to discern what is real, and what is not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the night, you'll play as Kat while she attempts to survive an onslaught of dangerous manifestations. Various<strong> hallucinations</strong> will appear and distort the surrounding house. You will need to photograph them to stay alive, or else they will rapidly raise your anxiety to lethal heights. Alongside hallucinations, other entities will appear that will attempt to let toxins into the house, short circuit the power, and even attack you directly. Survive for 2 in-game hours until Eleanor arrives to drive you to safety.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101770/extras/3f8c1197cedeef1192744ca136b9b029.poster.avif?t=1761062311\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101770/extras/3f8c1197cedeef1192744ca136b9b029.webm?t=1761062311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101770/extras/3f8c1197cedeef1192744ca136b9b029.mp4?t=1761062311\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Black Fog contains<strong> fully voiced</strong> story cutscenes, but the game can be played without them. Higher difficulties are available which will significantly increase the rate of hallucinations and enemy activity. With over <strong>200+ hallucinations</strong> to find and fully random entity behaviour, each playthrough will not be the same as the last.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4101770?t=1761062311","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4101770?t=1761062311","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101770/ad3b84341cf7074263f3eca0a4125d15b41e3002/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761062311","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101770/ad3b84341cf7074263f3eca0a4125d15b41e3002/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761062311","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Possible encounters of blood and gore imagery. Insinuated self harm imagery.\r\n\r\nReferential dialogue to substance abuse."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101770/extras/2666939de3dc29f7fd04dfe77e39eb1d.poster.avif?t=1761062311\" width=1170 height=534 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101770/extras/2666939de3dc29f7fd04dfe77e39eb1d.webm?t=1761062311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101770/extras/2666939de3dc29f7fd04dfe77e39eb1d.mp4?t=1761062311\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Black Fog</strong> is a survival horror with narrative elements, following the story of Kat and Eleanor, two ex-band members who haven't spoken in over two years. When a dark fog infused with a deadly neurotoxin encompasses the nation, Kat is inflicted with rampant hallucinations, unable to discern what is real, and what is not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the night, you'll play as Kat while she attempts to survive an onslaught of dangerous manifestations. Various<strong> hallucinations</strong> will appear and distort the surrounding house. You will need to photograph them to stay alive, or else they will rapidly raise your anxiety to lethal heights. Alongside hallucinations, other entities will appear that will attempt to let toxins into the house, short circuit the power, and even attack you directly. Survive for 2 in-game hours until Eleanor arrives to drive you to safety.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101770/extras/3f8c1197cedeef1192744ca136b9b029.poster.avif?t=1761062311\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101770/extras/3f8c1197cedeef1192744ca136b9b029.webm?t=1761062311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101770/extras/3f8c1197cedeef1192744ca136b9b029.mp4?t=1761062311\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Black Fog contains<strong> fully voiced</strong> story cutscenes, but the game can be played without them. Higher difficulties are available which will significantly increase the rate of hallucinations and enemy activity. With over <strong>200+ hallucinations</strong> to find and fully random entity behaviour, each playthrough will not be the same as the last.</p>","developers":["RedPolarGames"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101770/a8324720063ee16f31f46035fa28a027c2011012/header.jpg?t=1761062311","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4101770/779543218/c764cf35f2a7a9dcdddb862b89d99eb3ba23c0b4/1760485692/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761062308","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4101770/779543218/c764cf35f2a7a9dcdddb862b89d99eb3ba23c0b4/1760485692/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761062308","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4101770/779543218/c764cf35f2a7a9dcdddb862b89d99eb3ba23c0b4/1760485692/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761062308","id":257217983,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257217983/movie480.mp4?t=1761062308","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257217983/movie_max.mp4?t=1761062308"},"name":"BlackFog","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257217983/7b5e9510a2de386df6181c39ace49fde434aaecb/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1761